            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>Sacerd to Hercules. Marcus Mascarpius Symphorio, senior sexvir and Augustalis, worshipper of the divine household, honoured with the decurional ornaments by the most splendid order [of decurions] of Mediolanum, with Mascarpius Festus, his son, Roman eques [furnished] with the public horse, junior sexvir, decurion, he fulfilled this vow.</p>
            </div>
